{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20260uXOPtk22s1794749895.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>國務院總理李強抵達菲律賓，將出席中國-東盟領導人會議。</p><p></p><p>李強乘包機由泰國轉抵馬尼拉。菲律賓財政部長吳詩澤和中國駐菲律賓大使井泉、駐東盟大使王擎等到機場迎接。</p><p></p><p>中方早前表示，期待通過今次與會，與東盟國家增進團結互信，凝聚合作共識，推動中國-東盟自貿區3.0版升級議定書盡快生效，深化人工智能(AI)等領域合作。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T14:22:13.325991+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T13:01:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T17:54:37.047140+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T14:15:42.207007+00:00","content_hash":"c993cf271d6ffc63d40ec16a374c06c8845cfad9b2c2137ea66d96e34350b753","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-15T14:22:13.325991+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}